> > > > > > Ignoring the missing data, could I arbitrarily assign/recode the markers and just look for a running average like you said? That doesn't seem like it would work in my head.
> > > > > >
> > > > > > Alternatively, arbitrarily assigning 1 or 0 to the genotype and then summing trait = 0 and subtracting the sum of trait = 1 and looking for markers that are close to 0 a good idea?
> > > > > >
> > > > > > Or am I missing (many) things?
> > > > > >
> > > > > > Thanks,
